# CI Gates

## Post-Push Poll (required)

After push to `main` or before release sign-off:

```powershell
.\scripts\pns_check_github_ci.ps1 -WaitSeconds 300
```

Required green (P&S names): **Toolchain verify**, **Security scan**, **CodeQL**.

## Gate order (local)

1. Tier 0: `.\scripts\pns_local_dev_parallel.ps1` (includes bootstrap validate)
2. Tier 1: `.\scripts\pns_prerelease_gate.ps1 -SkipGradle`
3. Tier 2: `.\scripts\pns_verify_toolchain.ps1 -RunTests`
4. Tier 3 USB: capture **then** chrome (one serial); force-stop after
5. Push → `pns_check_github_ci.ps1`

## Do Not Mark Complete

- BUILD_PLAN `[AUTO]` items while required CI is red
- Device-facing rows ✅ without USB proof (`AGENTS.md` device truth rule)
